Configuring loopback interfaces.
Enabling OSPF on router interfaces.
Establishing OSPF neighbor adjacencies.
Configuring and changing OSPF router IDs.
Inspecting OSPF neighbor states.
Examining DR and BDR elections.
Comparing interface costs.
Testing equal-cost routing paths.
