Also tested clearing the OSPF process to observe router-ID changes and adjacency formation.

Routing Concepts Practiced

OSPF DR/BDR Election

Observed how designated routers and backup designated routers are elected independently on broadcast network segments.

Studied the effects of interface priority, router ID, and non-preemptive election behavior.

Equal-Cost Multipath (ECMP)

Configured a topology with multiple equal-cost paths toward a destination.

Observed how multiple next hops can be installed in the routing table and examined Cisco Express Forwarding (CEF) as the packet-forwarding mechanism.

OSPF Link-State Advertisements

Studied LSA Types 1–5, including:

Router LSAs
Network LSAs
Summary LSAs
ASBR Summary LSAs
External LSAs
Focused on the roles of ABRs, ASBRs, and OSPF areas in distributing routing information.

